	And CalendarNavigator goto Next Day
	And CalendarNavigator goto Next Day
	And CalendarEvent add Via Day View
		|eventTitle|Future Day Event|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Calendar choose Site Calendar Menulist Option
		|menuListOption|RSS|
