	And Calendar view RSS Feed Event Present
		|calendarName|${siteName}|
		|eventTitle|Future Day Event|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|siteCalendarName|${siteName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	Then Navigator close Window

